WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.311
Hello!

2
00:00:02.312 --> 00:00:06.008
Who

3
00:00:06.009 --> 00:00:09.281
are you? I'm

4
00:00:09.282 --> 00:00:13.018
a sea lion. We

5
00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:17.392
are sea mammals. Where

6
00:00:17.393 --> 00:00:19.594
do you live? Most

7
00:00:19.595 --> 00:00:24.786
sea lions live near the Pacific Ocean. We

8
00:00:24.787 --> 00:00:28.268
live along the coast. We

9
00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:32.463
also live on islands. You

10
00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:35.937
look like a seal. We

11
00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:39.025
are different from seals. We

12
00:00:39.026 --> 00:00:42.821
can walk with our strong flippers. Seals

13
00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:46.352
can't do that. Are

14
00:00:46.353 --> 00:00:49.016
you a good swimmer? Yes.

15
00:00:49.017 --> 00:00:52.824
We are great swimmers. We're

16
00:00:52.825 --> 00:00:55.697
really fast. We

17
00:00:55.698 --> 00:00:59.783
can also dive deep.

18
00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:03.311
You have a lot of friends!

19
00:01:03.312 --> 00:01:07.222
Sea lions live in big groups.

20
00:01:07.223 --> 00:01:11.228
We lie in the sun together.

21
00:01:11.229 --> 00:01:17.162
And we bark very loudly.

22
00:01:17.163 --> 00:01:20.519
What do you eat?

23
00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.520
We eat lots of fish.

24
00:01:24.521 --> 00:01:29.012
We also like squid and shellfish.

25
00:01:29.013 --> 00:01:32.361
Do you have any enemies?

26
00:01:32.362 --> 00:01:35.679
Killer whales hunt us.

27
00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:40.190
Great white sharks hunt us too.

28
00:01:40.191 --> 00:01:43.471
I'm going to lie in the sun.

29
00:01:43.472 --> 00:01:48.179
See you later!

30
00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.970
Good-bye, Sea Lion!

